tantivy-harmonyos is an unofficial fixed-schema C ABI adapter and OpenHarmony
cross-compilation example. It is not an official Tantivy or Huawei project.

Tantivy 0.26.2: https://github.com/quickwit-oss/tantivy (MIT).
Jieba-rs 0.8.1: https://github.com/messense/jieba-rs (MIT).
See Cargo.lock for all pinned transitive dependencies. Their licenses continue
to apply. Bundled tokenizer dictionary data also retains its upstream notices.

No upstream Tantivy source modifications are currently required by this adapter.
This statement does not imply that every Tantivy API or feature is supported.

Precompiled distributions include the resolved Cargo dependency notices and
Rust standard-library license materials under licenses/. Build-time packages
are included conservatively; not every listed dependency is linked at runtime.
See third_party/DICTIONARY.md for embedded dictionary and HMM data sources.
